["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">変</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奇怪；奇异；怪异；离奇；可疑；意外；出人意料；变化；改变；事变；骚乱；灾难；事故；紧急情况；（音乐）降（表示降半音，用作前缀）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213316\">そのオレンジは<ruby>後味<rp>(</rp><rt>あとあじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>へん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那种橙色是奇怪的味道。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">編</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">编纂；编辑；卷；册；著作；成书</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地区；附近；周围；（数学）边（多边形的边、图的边）；情况；环境；状况</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223208\">この<ruby>辺<rp>(</rp><rt>へん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にホテルはありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">附近有酒店吗？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/1335409\" title=\"Tatoeba · vicch\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · vicch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">変化</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へんか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"