=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">编辑；编纂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197285\">ビルは<ruby>編集<rp>(</rp><rt>へんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>部員<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">建筑是编辑员。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">返事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へんじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">回复；答复；回答</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214756\">すぐ<ruby>返事<rp>(</rp><rt>へんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしてもらいたいと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我希望你能立即回复。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">変遷</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变迁；转变；沧桑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85357\"><ruby>表面上<rp>(</rp><rt>ひょうめんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>本書<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>大部分<rp>(</rp><rt>だいぶぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>一連<rp>(</rp><rt>いちれん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>事例<rp>(</rp><rt>じれい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>変遷<rp>(</rp><rt>へんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>記録<rp>(</rp><rt>きろく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したものである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">表面上,本书的大部分记录了一系列案例的变化。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">返答</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">へんとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a>