。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书曾经是最畅销的,但现在已经完全出版了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">別荘</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">べっそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">度假屋；度假别墅；别墅；监狱；牢狱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90753\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>海辺<rp>(</rp><rt>うみべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>別荘<rp>(</rp><rt>べっそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她在海边有一个别墅。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ベッド</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">床；床铺</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199480\">どんなベッドでもないよりはよい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">比任何床都好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">別</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">べつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">区别；差异；差别；单独的；不同的；另外的；额外的；例外；除外；按照；根据；分类</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229318\">いう<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>おこな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまったく<ruby>別<rp>(</rp><rt>べつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">做事和做事是完全不同的。</spa